				<guid>http://www.scpwiki.com/forum/t-899112#post-2067503</guid>
				<title>(no title)</title>
				<link>http://www.scpwiki.com/forum/t-899112/volume-55-13-a-96:of-the-retooling-of-sector-92-production-l#post-2067503</link>
				<description></description>
				<pubDate>Fri, 11 Jul 2014 14:24:44 +0000</pubDate>
				<wikidot:authorName>Von Pincier</wikidot:authorName>				<wikidot:authorUserId>1315056</wikidot:authorUserId>				<content:encoded>
					<![CDATA[
						 <p>It's an entirely valid concern, I know. I've definitely had a hell of a time editing and putting together these pieces of Writ because they're so textually dense (the way Wikidot formats footnotes doesn't help matters much). That being said, given the way we laid out the formatting on our Hub, it would be totally acceptable to create Orthodoxy writ without the footnote and commentary- it might still be dense due to writing style, but omitting the added detail is totally an option and might allow for better narrative flow.</p> 
				 	]]>
				</content:encoded>							</item>
					<item>
				<guid>http://www.scpwiki.com/forum/t-899112#post-2066432</guid>
				<title>(no title)</title>
				<link>http://www.scpwiki.com/forum/t-899112/volume-55-13-a-96:of-the-retooling-of-sector-92-production-l#post-2066432</link>
				<description></description>
				<pubDate>Wed, 09 Jul 2014 20:08:23 +0000</pubDate>
				<wikidot:authorName>anqxyr</wikidot:authorName>				<wikidot:authorUserId>966960</wikidot:authorUserId>				<content:encoded>
					<![CDATA[
						 <p>This, more or less. While I like this a lot, it's supposed to be an example of a standard Orthodoxy format, and I don't really see people writing something like that, and if they will, I imagine it'll get repetitive fast.</p> <p>But, still, I think this is really cool, and I upvoted it. My concerns are about the format and accessibility of the Writ, not about the quality of the piece itself.</p> 
				 	]]>
				</content:encoded>							</item>
					<item>
				<guid>http://www.scpwiki.com/forum/t-899112#post-2065995</guid>
				<title>(no title)</title>
				<link>http://www.scpwiki.com/forum/t-899112/volume-55-13-a-96:of-the-retooling-of-sector-92-production-l#post-2065995</link>
				<description></description>
				<pubDate>Wed, 09 Jul 2014 04:45:45 +0000</pubDate>
				<wikidot:authorName>Communism will win</wikidot:authorName>				<wikidot:authorUserId>617958</wikidot:authorUserId>				<content:encoded>
					<![CDATA[
						 <p>Ugh. I can tell that a lot of creativity went into the format and the writing, and I applaud you for that, but this has a lot of clutter (from a narrative standpoint) and it's very difficult to follow what's going on. I would not want to read a series of documents written like this, nor would I be interested in writing in this format.</p> 
				 	]]>
				</content:encoded>							</item>
